VALUES (391138, 'tt4505122', NULL, 'Two Birds, One Stone', 'D''une pierre deux coups', 'movie', 2016, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO4JJmBDs79PgruGLcHseIdtXe2.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jRyUBRy41T7Y15PlnexgU7CPDIx.jpg', 'Zayane is 75. Since arriving in France, she has never left her neighborhood. One day, she receives a letter informing her of the death of a man she once knew in Algeria. She sets off on a day trip to collect a box that the deceased left her. During her absence, her eleven children gather in her apartment and discover a part of their mother''s life that was previously unknown to them all...', NULL, NULL, 0.4504, 4.2, 0, 1.32, '2026-11-21 03:29:05', '2026-11-21 03:29:05')
